        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions SNJ3015TWDSSTFRD, Spiral Hand Forged Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis spiral black iron pull will compliment any traditionally styled decor. Its old world detailing makes it a great choice for use on big doors for a medieval look. The First Impressions San Juan Collection Series 3 Pull is 15-3/4 inches long.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nThese spiral pulls come in super tough powder coated Matte Black, dark Duro Bronze or Lithonia (oil rubbed bronze) finishes.\r\n</p>\r\n <p>\r\n<b>Surface Mounting:</b> Pull screws to the face of the door. Standard for 1-1/4\" or thicker wood, composite or metal doors. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the First Impressions San Juan Series 3 Door Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Pull Length: 15\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Centers: 8-11/16\" </li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Max Projection: 3.64\"</li> \r\n<li>Clearance: 2.47\"</li> \r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-SNJ03-specifcations.pdf?v=1704262272\" target=\"new\"><b>First Impressions SNJ3015TWDSSTFRD Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nNote: This door handle is hand finished in the USA when you order it. Unfortunately, because of the made-to-order nature of the door handle, it is <b>Not Cancelable or Returnable.</b> Please <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> with your requirements or if you have any questions.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually (1 door pull handle).</i>\r\n</p>",
